01:32:52.740 --> 01:32:54.911
I think POTUS is movin' out.

1062
01:32:55.313 --> 01:32:56.779
Don't shoot. don't shoot.

1063
01:33:06.353 --> 01:33:07.353
Don't...

1064
01:33:41.686 --> 01:33:43.120
(DISTANT GUNSHOTS)

1065
01:34:07.481 --> 01:34:08.882
This place is empty.

1066
01:34:19.628 --> 01:34:21.256
Just stay the fuck
out of our way.

1067
01:34:30.369 --> 01:34:31.369
(GUNFIRE)

1068
01:34:42.813 --> 01:34:44.213
(INDISTINCT CONVERSATION)

1069
01:34:58.292 --> 01:34:59.963
Secret Service agent.
Joy Butler.

1070
01:35:00.065 --> 01:35:03.000
- Drop it.
- JOY: I'm unarmed. I'm here to talk.

1071
01:35:03.668 --> 01:35:05.530
- Take it?
- Flood it.

1072
01:35:14.707 --> 01:35:17.008
I'm here to negotiate
the surrender of the president.

1073
01:35:17.110 --> 01:35:18.281
(CAMERA SHUTTER CLICKS)

1074
01:35:18.384 --> 01:35:19.547
He's here.

1075
01:35:19.649 --> 01:35:21.051
You the WF?

1076
01:35:21.751 --> 01:35:23.955
Take a wild guess.

1077
01:35:24.057 --> 01:35:27.021
Can the president be entrusted
into your safe care?

1078
01:35:27.124 --> 01:35:29.723
Yes. ma'am. We'll take
real good care of him.

1079
01:35:29.825 --> 01:35:31.160
Just bring him out here.

1080
01:35:31.262 --> 01:35:33.206
We're not bringing him anywhere
until we have agreed terms.

1081
01:35:33.230 --> 01:35:35.393
You need to guarantee a safe
passage for the president.

1082
01:35:35.495 --> 01:35:38.766
And we need extraction
to a neutral territory.

1083
01:35:38.869 --> 01:35:40.938
We request Greenland or Alaska.

1084
01:35:41.670 --> 01:35:42.834
Nah. no terms.

1085
01:35:42.936 --> 01:35:44.475
Bring him out here.

1086
01:35:44.577 --> 01:35:45.841
MAN: We gotta move. sergeant.

1087
01:35:45.943 --> 01:35:47.538
Ma'am. the President
is willing...

1088
01:35:48.878 --> 01:35:51.278
Gunter! Poi! Jack!
Move him!

1089
01:35:58.083 --> 01:35:59.990
Come on. get back!

1090
01:36:06.463 --> 01:36:07.463
Just go. Go!

1091
01:36:08.599 --> 01:36:09.599
(CAMERA SHUTTER CLICKING)

1092
01:36:19.543 --> 01:36:20.543
Out! Reloading!

1093
01:36:23.614 --> 01:36:24.948
(INDISTINCT SHOUTING)

1094
01:36:27.981 --> 01:36:28.981
- Get back!
- Get back!

1095
01:36:29.048 --> 01:36:30.484
- Look out!
- I got him!

1096
01:36:30.586 --> 01:36:31.949
Give it up!

1097
01:36:32.051 --> 01:36:33.587
(SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

1098
01:36:33.689 --> 01:36:35.123
Ready to crash!

1099
01:36:35.853 --> 01:36:37.059
Sir!

1100
01:36:40.895 --> 01:36:43.295
I'm out. Reloading. reloading.

1101
01:36:48.934 --> 01:36:50.137
MAN 3: Press back.

1102
01:36:51.703 --> 01:36:52.768
Sir!

1103
01:36:52.870 --> 01:36:54.042
Crash it!

1104
01:36:57.611 --> 01:36:59.412
Go! Go!

1105
01:36:59.514 --> 01:37:00.576
Move it.

1106
01:37:02.012 --> 01:37:03.678
Wait! Wait!

1107
01:37:06.390 --> 01:37:07.957
Don't move!

1108
01:37:13.123 --> 01:37:14.659
Chief. clear way!

1109
01:37:14.761 --> 01:37:16.390
Roger that!

1110
01:37:16.492 --> 01:37:18.892
Fuck the cross!
Fuck the cross!

1111
01:37:18.994 --> 01:37:20.133
Check.

1112
01:37:20.567 --> 01:37:21.729
Forward.

1113
01:37:21.831 --> 01:37:23.946
Cutter. I'm moving across.
I need you to lead us in fire.

1114
01:37:23.970 --> 01:37:25.236
Charger. you're going left.

1115
01:37:25.338 --> 01:37:28.176
Follow me. I'm going left.
You move when I move.

1116
01:37:28.278 --> 01:37:29.272
Copy you!

1117
01:37:29.273 --> 01:37:30.875
- Guys ready to move?
- Ready. ten!

1118
01:37:30.976 --> 01:37:32.576
Move! Move back!
Move!

1119
01:37:32.678 --> 01:37:33.678
Let's go!

1120
01:37:36.114 --> 01:37:38.283
(ALL SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

1121
01:37:51.796 --> 01:37:53.034
You good?

1122
01:37:54.634 --> 01:37:55.728
Stay down.

1123
01:38:02.444 --> 01:38:03.609
Beacon flare!

1124
01:38:03.711 --> 01:38:05.309
Move! You gotta move on!

1125
01:38:05.844 --> 01:38:07.007
Move. move. go!

1126
01:38:07.109 --> 01:38:08.510
- Move it!
- Moving.

1127
01:38:10.616 --> 01:38:11.616
Ready.

1128
01:38:12.788 --> 01:38:14.318
Break out. break out. break out.

1129
01:38:21.630 --> 01:38:23.697
Shakir! Shakir! Shakir!

1130
01:38:23.799 --> 01:38:26.066
- I'm out. Reloading.
- Changing.

1131
01:38:27.700 --> 01:38:28.700
Perfect crash!

1132
01:38:31.903 --> 01:38:35.338
(CAMERA SHUTTER CLICKING)

1133
01:38:58.058 --> 01:39:02.167
(PANTING)

1134
01:40:17.807 --> 01:40:18.868
JOEL: Wait!

1135
01:40:20.479 --> 01:40:21.479
Wait!

1136
01:40:22.480 --> 01:40:23.480
(PANTING)

1137
01:40:31.953 --> 01:40:33.321
I need a quote.

1138
01:40:34.685 --> 01:40:37.391
Don't let... Don't let them
kill me.

1139
01:40:40.731 --> 01:40:43.463
Yeah. that will do.

1140
01:40:51.172 --> 01:40:53.902
